t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Signs_with_materials.png/revision/latest?cb=20250715102210\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Filled\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Signs_with_materials.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250715102210\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Signs_with_materials.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250715102210 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d8/Signs_with_materials.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250715102210 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Filled\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Signs with materials.png\" data-image-name=\"Signs with materials.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finley, Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$340</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Sign</b> is a schematic that can be purchased from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a>. It is a block that can show text. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Functionality\">Functionality</span></h2>\n<p>Until the schematic is completely filled, the Sign will only display placeholder text that says \"Fill me with material to edit text\", instructing the user to fill the schematic with a material in order to edit the text. The text on the Sign will always attempt to fill the sign completely to its edges. Once filled, the Sign will be auto-filled with \"This is some text!\" as a placeholder. A player with the correct permissions can edit the sign, and set the text to whatever they want. Signs support a subset of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://create.roblox.com/docs/en-us/ui/rich-text#supported-tags\">Roblox's rich text formatting</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>For details on how to use Rich Text in signs, go to <a href=\"/wiki/Sign_Text_Formatting\" title=\"Sign Text Formatting\">Sign Text Formatting</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.2.0#Changes:_6\" title=\"Version 1.2.0\">Version 1.2.0#Changes: 6</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901121936\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 71/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 183/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019391/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.835      1 Template:Schematics\n100.00%   33.835      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1069-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901121936 and revision id 20370. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Schematics"],"links":[{"title":"Illumine Designs","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Sign Text Formatting","exists":true},{"title":"Version 1.2.0","exists":true}],"images":["Sing_Schematic.png","Signs_without_materials.png","Signs_with_materials.png"